From: luxus <7449+luxus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 15:34:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] fix(vdisplay): detect NixOS-wrapped compositors via
 /proc/comm

Nix rewrites binaries to .<name>-wrapped; TASK_COMM_LEN truncates that to
forms like .kwin_wayland-w, so exact "kwin_wayland" matching missed a live
KWin session and the host reported no usable compositor.

Match exact names and Nix wrap truncations (hyphen suffix), skip the
_wrapper helper, and reuse the same logic for foreign gamescope scans.
Also expose bindToGraphicalSession on the NixOS module so desktop restarts
refresh the host's Wayland/portal connections.
